# Raw and derived audio datasets -- too large for git, and either redistributable from their
# original source or rebuildable from the small list/metadata files that ARE committed.
# See README.md ("Setup" / "Fine-tune on your own dataset") and data/README.md for how to
# re-fetch or rebuild each one. None of these are needed to USE the shipped checkpoints
# (speak.py, demo/, evaluation) -- only to re-gate or retrain from scratch.
/data/1_source/voice/wav/
/data/1_source/rasa/*.parquet
/data/3_training_lists/*/wavs/

# Pretrained weights downloaded from Hugging Face -- not ours to redistribute, and the
# originals are public. Fetch with src/fetch_pretrained.py (see README: Setup).
/models/base/matcha_urdu.ckpt
/models/vocoder/pytorch_model.bin

# The kiosk's own .env, kept in server/mari_backup_*/ so its TTS wiring can be reverted
# (see server/MARI_CHANGES.md). It holds live API keys: keep it on disk, out of history.
server/mari_backup_*/.env

# Python / editor noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
